876ab046479166b869afc6896d288183bbc0e5843f141200c677b3e8dfb11724

Local minimal fix: strict-mode control-byte comparison must be unsigned.
The original tarball is preserved. Apply this exact change to native and
target builds. Valid UTF8 is accepted; invalid UTF8 and unescaped ASCII
control characters remain rejected. See evidence/demo/T03/utf8-probe.

--- a/json_tokener.c
+++ b/json_tokener.c
@@ -681,1 +681,1 @@
-				else if ((tok->flags & JSON_TOKENER_STRICT) && c <= 0x1f)
+				else if ((tok->flags & JSON_TOKENER_STRICT) && (unsigned char)c <= 0x1f)
